        <mxCell id="risks" value="&lt;b&gt;Risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. quiet-eyes-backend auto-deploys &lt;i&gt;master&lt;/i&gt; and its build runs prisma db push --accept-data-loss. Only a missing DATABASE_URL stops it.&lt;br&gt;2. BE in Oregon, DB in Ireland, users in Israel: every query crosses the Atlantic.&lt;br&gt;3. No CI gate, no BE health check, and /api/health always reports ok:false.&lt;br&gt;4. Web traffic and every cron job share one 512 MB instance." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
