        <mxCell id="t-notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Decisions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Region: Frankfurt (~55 ms from Israel per API call; DB queries &amp;lt; 2 ms)&lt;br&gt;• Database: RDS, migrated from Supabase including all data&lt;br&gt;• Single-AZ RDS now, Multi-AZ later&lt;br&gt;• No NAT gateway: tasks get public IPs but accept traffic only from the ALB&lt;br&gt;• All infrastructure defined in AWS CDK (TypeScript)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
